{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which integer is closest in value to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb12a8a8bcb2c955c16c7809be74299a4e2d751a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{35}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c75fc8d85275c2ab3b8698edea166919fc58678.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/3/ae3eca502e3f9458a38f1ed75987f6889c3914c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{32}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/7/7b751072ae6b5443f040fd02e7cca01f86972d4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{36}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb12a8a8bcb2c955c16c7809be74299a4e2d751a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{35}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> is between these values, but is closer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/f/aff51a3a773de15c96671251322d660e76f43857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb12a8a8bcb2c955c16c7809be74299a4e2d751a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{35}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/0/010c16fc5d6a30361add70447db89b83506c0c56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />. This is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but is closer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/f/aff51a3a773de15c96671251322d660e76f43857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_G